          <input type="checkbox" id="pricing-faq--subscription-terms" />
          <label for="pricing-faq--subscription-terms"><h5>Subscription terms</h5></label>
          <p class="description">Tower is offered as a standard subscription: you'll have access to Tower (including updates and support) as long as your subscription is active / paid for. If you cancel your subscription, access to Tower ends when the most recently paid-up subscription period ends.</p>
        </div>

