          <input type="checkbox" id="pricing-faq--refunds" />
          <label for="pricing-faq--refunds"><h5>Refund policy</h5></label>
          <p class="description">We try to keep refunds simple for our users. If you purchased Tower and changed your mind, let us know within 30 days and we'll be happy to refund you. No questions asked! Even better, test Tower first with our 30-day free trial. </p>
